Package: peptideCalculations
Type: Package
Title: Unit-Safe Peptide Solution Calculations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Peptido Mexico Open Science", email = "hola@peptidomexico.com.mx", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Peptido Mexico Open Science [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Peptido Mexico Open Science <hola@peptidomexico.com.mx>
Description: Transparent, unit-safe calculations for preparing peptide solutions.
    Functions cover reconstitution volume, concentration, dilution planning,
    and molarity. The package is research-use-only software and does not
    provide dosing, administration, or clinical interpretation.
